(text "3.3 V logic only. Hardware faults asynchronously clear enable; recovery requires a fresh ARM rising edge.\nIgnition OC joins HW_KILL_N through R6500. Per-load inhibition lives on driver sheets.\n64.288 ms nominal watchdog is a backup CPU monitor, NOT a coil dwell/current limiter." (at 20 23 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bc443ad6-c7bd-577d-a10e-48be345ba9f6"))
